l><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> 19 Steam achievements.</li></ul><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Customizable controls and gamepad.</li></ul>",
            "short_description": "100 levels with three difficulty levels - Casual, Hardcore and Ultra mode. On Ultra Mode, we take no responsibility for any broken keyboards or gamepads.",
